      "message": "Sure I can do this, though I think the switch is still necessary to calculate the byte size of the attribute, but I put the byte calculation logic into a function in SkMeshPriv.h (`SkMeshSpecificationPriv::AttrTypeByteSize()`) to keep this function cleaner.",
