      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T19:15:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changing the primitive type to triangles did indeed solve this issue. I removed the other MeshRenderStep variant and can reintroduce it once we have gpu-backed buffers where we wouldn\u0027t run into this issue because of the flushing.\n\nI did notice that there were no GMs testing SkVertices using the TriangleStrips primitive mode so I can address that testing gap in another CL along with having VerticesRenderStep only use the triangles primitive mode (b/546620104).",
      "parentUuid": "29d78c7e_f5e2f3c8",
